  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering the Children of Migrant Labourers Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will create participatory systems and mechanisms for the children of migrant workers communities in Bangalore. It will enable the children to collect, analyse and use the information to advocate for their rights to care and protection and hold the Urban Local and district Governments accountable. It will also bring awareness, capacitate and support the migrant workers community to reduce alcohol abuse at the community level to secure the children&#x2019;s right to protection.</narrative>
  </description>
